# WITHOUT THIS FILE THE DEPLOYED SITE HAS NO HERO.
#
# Vercel falls back to .gitignore when there is no .vercelignore, and this
# repo gitignores *.mp4 deliberately — the videos are large binaries that are
# kept on disk rather than in git history. That is right for the repository
# and wrong for a deployment: saferide-hero-av1.mp4 and saferide-hero-idle.mp4
# are what the hero plays, and without them the first screen is a poster
# frame and nothing else.
#
# So this file exists to say what the DEPLOYMENT excludes, which is a
# different question from what git tracks. Everything under public/ ships.

node_modules
.next
out
.git
.env*.local

# Build tooling and diagnostics. None of it is served.
build
__tests__
*.test.ts
*.test.tsx

# The untrimmed masters. Only the encoded variants are referenced by the site,
# and public/ is deployed wholesale, so these would otherwise ship 22 MB and
# 6.6 MB of source nobody fetches.
public/video/saferide-hero.mp4
public/gemini-background
public/screenshots
